# T4 · dir2 G-7: 위로 가면 떠난 폴더가 캐럿 + 단일 선택 · 히스토리 뒤로 가능.
id: nav-up-select
title: 위로 = 떠난 폴더 선택 · 뒤로/앞으로
tree: dir sub/deep
tree: dir zeta
tree: file a.txt 5
settings: ui.lang=en
cmd: @ready:nav:<root>/sub
cmd: @ready:nav.up
cmd: @ready:panel.dump:<out>/panel.txt
cmd: @ready:list.dump:<out>/list.txt
cmd: @ready:assert.panel:back true
cmd: @ready:nav.back
cmd: @ready:assert.panel:path <root>/sub
cmd: @ready:nav.forward
cmd: @ready:assert.panel:path <root>
cmd: @ready:quit
check: panel.txt: path <root>
check: panel.txt: selected 1 caret Some(0)
check: panel.txt: back true forward false
check: list.txt: 0 d0 Collapsed *sub |
check: list.txt: 1 d0 Collapsed zeta |
check: list.txt: a.txt | txt | 5 B |
